---
// v2 architecture: clients (WS) → tokio tasks → ONE dedicated engine OS thread (single writer,
// no locks) → SPMC/broadcast out → projection + market-data (20Hz). Journal WAL tees off ingress
// without gating the engine. SPSC ring in, SPMC ring out.
const W = 640, H = 340;
// column x-centers
const colClients = 66;
const colTasks = 232;
const colEngine = 420;
const colOut = 574;
const bw = 118, bwEng = 108, bwSm = 108;
// tokio task boxes
const tasks = ['gateway', 'ingress + sequencer', 'egress'];
const taskTop = 70, taskH = 40, taskGap = 14;
const engineY = 128, engineH = 76;
const engineCx = colEngine, engineCy = engineY + engineH / 2;
---
<figure class="chart">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="v2 topology: WebSocket clients feed tokio tasks (gateway, ingress plus sequencer, egress). Ingress hands commands over an SPSC inbound ring to a single dedicated engine OS thread — one writer, no locks — which publishes over an SPMC broadcast outbound ring to projection and a 20Hz market-data feed back to egress. A journal write-ahead-log tees off ingress on a branch that does not gate the engine.">
    <defs>
      <marker id="nt-arr" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6.5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6.5,3 L0,6 Z" fill="var(--muted)" /></marker>
      <marker id="nt-arr-acc" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6.5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6.5,3 L0,6 Z" fill="var(--accent)" /></marker>
    </defs>

    {/* clients */}
    <rect x={colClients - bw / 2} y={taskTop + taskH} width={bw} height={taskH} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colClients} y={taskTop + taskH + 18} text-anchor="middle" class="btitle">clients</text>
    <text x={colClients} y={taskTop + taskH + 32} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub">WebSocket</text>

    {/* tokio tasks column */}
    <text x={colTasks} y={taskTop - 16} text-anchor="middle" class="colttl">tokio tasks</text>
    {tasks.map((t, i) => {
      const y = taskTop + i * (taskH + taskGap);
      return (
        <g>
          <rect x={colTasks - bw / 2} y={y} width={bw} height={taskH} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
          <text x={colTasks} y={y + taskH / 2 + 4} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">{t}</text>
        </g>
      );
    })}

    {/* clients → tasks */}
    <line x1={colClients + bw / 2} y1={taskTop + taskH + taskH / 2} x2={colTasks - bw / 2 - 3} y2={taskTop + taskH + taskH / 2} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#nt-arr)" />

    {/* engine thread (highlight) */}
    <rect x={colEngine - bwEng / 2} y={engineY} width={bwEng} height={engineH} rx="6" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x={engineCx} y={engineCy - 8} text-anchor="middle" class="btitle acc">engine thread</text>
    <text x={engineCx} y={engineCy + 8} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub">one dedicated OS thread</text>
    <text x={engineCx} y={engineCy + 22} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub acc">one writer · no locks</text>

    {/* ingress → SPSC in → engine */}
    {(() => { const iy = taskTop + 1 * (taskH + taskGap) + taskH / 2; return (
      <g>
        <line x1={colTasks + bw / 2} y1={iy} x2={colEngine - bwEng / 2 - 3} y2={engineCy} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#nt-arr-acc)" />
        <text x={(colTasks + bw / 2 + colEngine - bwEng / 2) / 2} y={(iy + engineCy) / 2 - 6} text-anchor="middle" class="ring">SPSC in</text>
      </g>
    ); })()}

    {/* engine → SPMC out → out column */}
    <line x1={colEngine + bwEng / 2} y1={engineCy} x2={colOut - bwSm / 2 - 3} y2={engineCy} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#nt-arr-acc)" />
    <text x={(colEngine + bwEng / 2 + colOut - bwSm / 2) / 2} y={engineCy - 8} text-anchor="middle" class="ring">SPMC out</text>

    {/* out column: projection + market-data */}
    <rect x={colOut - bwSm / 2} y={engineY - 6} width={bwSm} height={40} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colOut} y={engineY + 16} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">projection</text>
    <rect x={colOut - bwSm / 2} y={engineY + 44} width={bwSm} height={40} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colOut} y={engineY + 60} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">market-data</text>
    <text x={colOut} y={engineY + 74} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub">20 Hz</text>

    {/* market-data → egress (feedback) */}
    {(() => { const ey = taskTop + 2 * (taskH + taskGap) + taskH / 2; return (
      <path d={`M${colOut - bwSm / 2},${engineY + 64} Q${colTasks + bw / 2 + 40},${ey + 74} ${colTasks + bw / 2 + 3},${ey}`} fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#nt-arr)" />
    ); })()}

    {/* journal WAL tee off ingress (does NOT gate engine) */}
    {(() => { const iy = taskTop + 1 * (taskH + taskGap) + taskH / 2; return (
      <g>
        <line x1={colTasks} y1={iy + taskH / 2} x2={colTasks} y2={H - 62} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#nt-arr)" />
        <rect x={colTasks - 74} y={H - 60} width={148} height={38} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
        <text x={colTasks} y={H - 44} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">journal (WAL)</text>
        <text x={colTasks} y={H - 30} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub">tee · does not gate engine</text>
      </g>
    ); })()}
  </svg>
  <figcaption>A single dedicated engine thread is the only writer of book state, so ordering is deterministic and no locks are needed; commands arrive over an SPSC ring and results leave over an SPMC broadcast, and the journal WAL tees off ingress on a branch that never blocks the engine's hot path.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .chart { margin: 1.75rem 0; }
  .chart svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .chart figcaption {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .chart :global(.btitle) { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; }
  .chart :global(.btitle.acc) { fill: var(--accent); }
  .chart :global(.btask) { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-sans); }
  .chart :global(.bsub) { font-size: 10px; fill: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-sans); }
  .chart :global(.bsub.acc) { fill: var(--accent); }
  .chart :global(.colttl) { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .chart :global(.ring) { font-size: 10.5px; fill: var(--accent); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
</style>
